<div class="header-wrap">
  <div class="header-left">
    <div class="header-logo">
      {{#if tenant.logo_initials}}{{tenant.logo_initials}}{{else}}P{{/if}}
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="header-tenant-name">{{tenant.name}}</div>
      {{! Task 4.8: tagline/phone are business-identity info, not tax
          info — shown on both Tax and Proforma docs alike, unlike the
          GSTIN/PAN/State block below which stays gated on
          hideTenantTaxInfo. }}
      {{#if tenant.tagline}}<div class="header-tenant-tagline">{{tenant.tagline}}</div>{{/if}}
      {{#if tenant.phone}}<div class="header-tenant-tagline">Phone: {{tenant.phone}}</div>{{/if}}
      {{! Task 4.7: Proforma invoices omit the tenant's own
          GSTIN/PAN/State — they aren't tax documents, so this
          identity/registration block has no purpose there. Callers
          pass hideTenantTaxInfo=true (see invoice-proforma-*.hbs). }}
      {{#unless hideTenantTaxInfo}}
      <div class="header-tenant-address">
        {{#if tenant.gstin}}GSTIN: {{tenant.gstin}}{{/if}}
        {{#if tenant.pan}} | PAN: {{tenant.pan}}{{/if}}
        {{#if tenant.state_name}}<br>State: {{tenant.state_name}} ({{tenant.state_code}}){{/if}}
      </div>
      {{/unless}}
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="header-right">
    <div class="header-doc-title">{{docTitle}}</div>
    <div class="header-doc-meta">
      <div>
        <span class="label">{{docNumberLabel}}:</span>
        {{docNumber}}
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="label">{{docDateLabel}}:</span>
        {{formatDate docDate}}
      </div>
      {{! Task 4.7: gated on the same hideTenantTaxInfo flag as the
          GSTIN/PAN/State block above — Place of Supply is a GST
          concept and Proforma invoices aren't tax documents (Part B).
          Without this, placeOfSupplyStateName/StateCode would still
          render here even for Proforma templates that never pass
          them, since Handlebars partials inherit the full parent
          context, not just explicitly-passed hash arguments. }}
      {{#if placeOfSupplyStateName}}
      {{#unless hideTenantTaxInfo}}
      <div>
        <span class="label">Place of Supply:</span>
        {{placeOfSupplyStateName}}{{#if placeOfSupplyStateCode}} ({{placeOfSupplyStateCode}}){{/if}}
      </div>
      {{/unless}}
      {{/if}}
      {{! Task 4.8: only rendered when the invoice explicitly set
          reverse_charge (true or false) — see pdf.service.js's
          reverseChargePresent comment. A NULL (the overwhelming
          majority of existing + new invoices, since this is never
          defaulted) renders nothing, same graceful-omission pattern as
          every other never-fabricated field in this module. Gated on
          hideTenantTaxInfo like Place of Supply — Proforma docs aren't
          tax documents. }}
      {{#if reverseChargePresent}}
      {{#unless hideTenantTaxInfo}}
      <div>
        <span class="label">Reverse Charge:</span>
        {{reverseChargeLabel}}
      </div>
      {{/unless}}
      {{/if}}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
